      does: 'A Trigger is the one parameter you may not set every frame: it is an event, and the animator clears it once a transition has used it. This controller is waiting for it, but nothing in the enemy attacks yet.',
      doc: 'the `SetTrigger(string name)` row of this lesson\'s reference table, and the mouse-click trigger you wrote in 1.6',
