    },
  ],
  why: 'Notice the shape: find the machine, read its contract, choose a value, decide when to write it. Three of those four are things you already did in 1.6 for the Player. The new one is that the contract is not yours — in 1.6 you invented the numbers 0, 1 and 2 for WalkDir, and here you inherit four of them from a controller somebody else built. A wrong one is not an error message; it is an enemy that walks the wrong way.',
